<task id="002" project="spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Extend prototype seed: sprk_servicerequest + module-entitlement factories + 3-persona preset</title>
    <phase>P0 UX Design + Prototype</phase>
    <gate>blocked-until:001</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>New factory + preset files in the spaarke-prototype seed system (NOT production code); data-scaffolding with a §11 justification, no ADR-graded blast radius. FULL gates skipped per §8 STANDARD row.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Bounded data-factory authoring using an existing skill mechanism and a named reference factory to copy; no architectural judgment.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>medium</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits the shared _infra/seed system (factories + presets index) that other prototype work and sibling experiments share; concurrent edits to the seed index would collide. Serialize.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>001</deps>
